cds-outset-x: var(--cds-pad-xs);"><span id="_r_mo_-text" class="flex min-w-0 gap-xs items-center"><span id="_r_mo_-label" class="flex min-w-0 items-center"><span class="group/morph inline-grid items-center justify-items-start data-[gliding]:overflow-x-clip min-w-0 max-w-full"><span data-morph-key="done|Adding a looping video to the media gallery via GitHub." class="col-start-1 row-start-1 flex min-w-0 max-w-full items-center group-data-[gliding]/morph:max-w-none"><span class="min-w-0 overflow-x-clip text-ellipsis whitespace-nowrap py-[0.125em] -my-[0.125em] text-muted"><bdi>Adding a looping video to the media gallery via GitHub.</bdi></span></span></span></span></span></div><span class="sr-only" role="status" aria-live="polite">Adding a looping video to the media gallery via GitHub.</span></div></div></div></div><div class="row-start-2 col-start-1 relative grid grid-rows-[auto_auto] isolate min-w-0"><div class="row-start-1 col-start-1 relative z-[2] min-w-0"><div><div data-cds="Prose" class="prose" style="--_prose-font-body: var(--font-claude-response, var(--cds-font-voice)); --_prose-font-heading-display: var(--_prose-font-heading);"><div data-perf-reply-text="" class="_blocks_4za3l_47 standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [&amp;_&gt;_*]:min-w-0 whitespace-normal break-words print:block standard-markdown"><p dir="ltr">두 단계로 해야 해요.</p>
<p dir="ltr"><strong>1단계 — 영상 GitHub에 올리기</strong></p>
<ol dir="ltr">
<li><code>github.com/seyoung9/loop-web</code> 접속</li>
<li><code>assets</code> 폴더 클릭</li>
<li>오른쪽 상단 <code>...</code> → <strong>Upload files</strong> 클릭</li>
<li>영상 파일 업로드 후 파일 이름을 <code>promo.mp4</code> 로 변경</li>
<li><strong>Commit changes</strong> 클릭</li>
</ol>
<p dir="ltr"><strong>2단계 — index.html 수정</strong></p>
<p dir="ltr"><code>index.html</code> 편집 화면에서 아래 내용을 찾아서:</p>
