v class="font-claude-response relative leading-[1.65rem] [&amp;_pre&gt;div]:bg-bg-000/50 [&amp;_pre&gt;div]:border-0.5 [&amp;_pre&gt;div]:border-border-400 [&amp;_.ignore-pre-bg&gt;div]:bg-transparent [&amp;_.standard-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pl-[var(--msg-text-inset,0.5rem)] [&amp;_.standard-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,ul,ol,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pr-8 [&amp;_.progressive-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pl-[var(--msg-text-inset,0.5rem)] [&amp;_.progressive-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,ul,ol,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pr-8 [&amp;_.md-table-scroll]:pl-[var(--msg-block-inset,0.5rem)] [&amp;_.md-table-scroll]:pr-[var(--msg-inset-end,0.5rem)]"><div data-cds="Prose" class="prose" style="--_prose-font-body: var(--font-claude-response, var(--cds-font-voice)); --_prose-font-heading-display: var(--_prose-font-heading);"><div class="_blocks_4za3l_47 standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [&amp;_&gt;_*]:min-w-0 whitespace-normal break-words print:block standard-markdown"><p dir="ltr"><strong>1단계 — 영상 저장</strong></p>
<p dir="ltr">이 대화창에서 영상을 길게 눌러서 → <strong>다운로드</strong> 또는 <strong>저장</strong> 선택. 다운로드 폴더에 저장돼요.</p>
<hr>
<p dir="ltr"><strong>2단계 — Claude Code 열기</strong></p>
<p dir="ltr">PowerShell에서 <code>claude</code> 입력해서 Claude Code 실행.</p>
<hr>
<p dir="ltr"><strong>3단계 — 아래 명령어 붙여넣기</strong></p>
<div data-not-prose=""><div role="group" aria-label="코드" tabindex="0" class="relative group/copy bg-bg-000/50 border-0.5 border-border-400 rounded-[var(--msg-block-radius,0.5rem)] focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-accent-100"><div class="sticky opacity-0 group-hover/copy:opacity-100 group-focus-within/copy:opacity-100 pointer-coarse:opacity-100 [@media(hover:none)]:opacity-100 top-2 py-2 h-12 w-0 float-right"><div class="absolute right-0 h-8 px-2 items-center inline-flex z-10"><button type="button" data-cds="Button" data-cds-icon-only="" data-cds-ghost="" class="cds-reset group/btn relative isolate inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap select-none cursor-[var(--cds-cursor-interactive)] aria-disabled:cursor-default data-[disabled]:cursor-default border-0 outline-none focus-visible:outline-hidden [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:outline-hidden rounded h-control font-sans text-body [&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-disabled disabled:pointer-events-none transition-shadow duration-fast text-primary font-normal aria-pressed:text-accent focus-visible:shadow-focus [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:shadow-focus aspect-square w-control px-0 group-hover/copy:backdrop-blur-md group-focus-within/copy:backdrop-blur-md pointer-coarse:backdrop-blur-md [@media(hover:none)]:backdrop-blur-md" aria-label="클립보드에 복사" id="_r_cl_" data-base-ui-tooltip-trigger=""><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -z-[1] rounded-[inherit] inset-0 cds-btn-squish"><span data-cds-part="paint" class="absolute inset-0 rounded-[inherit] transition-[background-color,box-shadow,color] duration-fast ease-out group-focus-visible/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] group-[[data-initial-focus]:focus]/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] bg-transparent group-hover/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent "></span></span><span class="inline-flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1 "><span data-cds="Icon" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size: calc(1.25rem * var(--cds-rem-scale, 1)); font-weight: 433.3;"></span></span></button><span role="status" class="sr-only"></span></div></div><div class="overflow-x-auto"><pre class="code-block__code !my-0 !rounded-[var(--msg-block-radius,0.5rem)] !text-sm !leading-relaxed p-3.5" style="color: rgb(20, 24, 31); background: transparent; font-family: var(--font-mono);"><code style="color: rgb(20, 24, 31); background: transparent; font-family: var(--font-mono); white-space: pre-wrap;">다음 작업해줘.

1. git clone https://github.com/seyoung9/loop-web.git C:\Users\PC2503\Desktop\loop-web

2. C:\Users\PC2503\Downloads 폴더에서 가장 최근에 저장된 mp4 파일을 C:\Users\PC2503\Desktop\loop-web\assets\promo.mp4 로 복사해줘

3. index.html에서 아래를 찾아서:
&lt;div class="media-item"&gt;&lt;span class="media-placeholder"&gt;영상&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
아래로 교체해줘:
&lt;div class="media-item" style="padding:0;"&gt;&lt;video autoplay muted loop playsinline style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;"&gt;&lt;source src="./assets/promo.mp4" type="video/mp4"/&gt;&lt;/video&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

4. git add . &amp;&amp; git commit -m "feat: 소개 섹션 홍보 영상 추가" &amp;&amp; git push origin main 해줘</code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-cds="MessageActions" data-reveal="fade" role="toolbar" aria-label="메시지 작업" data-size="xs" tabindex="-1" class="flex items-center select-none [&amp;_button]:text-muted [&amp;_button:hover:not([aria-pressed=true])]:text-primary ml-[calc(var(--msg-text-inset,0.5rem)_-_0.375rem)] -mt-1" data-testid="message-actions"><button type="button" data-cds="Button" data-cds-icon-only="" data-cds-ghost="" data-size="xs" class="cds-reset group/btn relative isolate inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap select-none cursor-[var(--cds-cursor-interactive)] aria-disabled:cursor-default data-[disabled]:cursor-default border-0 outline-none focus-visible:outline-hidden [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:outline-hidden rounded h-control font-sans text-body [&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-disabled disabled:pointer-events-none transition-shadow duration-fast text-primary font-normal aria-pressed:text-accent focus-visible:shadow-focus [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:shadow-focus aspect-square w-control px-0" aria-label="복사" data-testid="action-bar-copy" id="_r_co_" data-base-ui-tooltip-trigger="" tabindex="0"><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -z-[1] rounded-[inherit] inset-0 cds-btn-squish"><span data-cds-part="paint" class="absolute inset-0 rounded-[inherit] transition-[background-color,box-shadow,color] duration-fast ease-out group-focus-visible/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] group-[[data-initial-focus]:focus]/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] bg-transparent group-hover/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent "></span></span><span class="inline-flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1 "><span data-cds="Icon" aria-hidden="t