atus" class="sr-only" data-find-omitted="" data-testid="failed-send-status-region"></span><div class="max-w-[85%]"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-rs-index="195" data-index="195" data-testid="transcript-row" data-last-message="true" data-perf-row="assistant" data-perf-row-from-tail="0" data-perf-row-streaming="false" style="display: flow-root; position: relative;"><div role="article" tabindex="-1" class="rounded-lg focus-visible:shadow-focus focus-visible:outline-hidden" aria-setsize="196" aria-posinset="196" aria-label="196개 메시지 중 196번째"><div data-test-render-count="1"><div class="group group/message-row"><div class="contents"><div data-testid="assistant-message" class="group relative relative pb-[var(--msg-assistant-pb,0.75rem)]" style="" data-is-streaming="false"><h2 data-find-omitted="" class="sr-only select-none">Claude 응답: 1단계 — 영상 저장</h2><div class="font-claude-response relative leading-[1.65rem] [&amp;_pre&gt;div]:bg-bg-000/50 [&amp;_pre&gt;div]:border-0.5 [&amp;_pre&gt;div]:border-border-400 [&amp;_.ignore-pre-bg&gt;div]:bg-transparent [&amp;_.standard-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pl-[var(--msg-text-inset,0.5rem)] [&amp;_.standard-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,ul,ol,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pr-8 [&amp;_.progressive-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pl-[var(--msg-text-inset,0.5rem)] [&amp;_.progressive-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,ul,ol,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pr-8 [&amp;_.md-table-scroll]:pl-[var(--msg-block-inset,0.5rem)] [&amp;_.md-table-scroll]:pr-[var(--msg-inset-end,0.5rem)]"><div class=""><div data-cds="Prose" class="prose" style="--_prose-font-body: var(--font-claude-response, var(--cds-font-voice)); --_prose-font-heading-display: var(--_prose-font-heading);"><div data-perf-reply-text="" class="_blocks_4za3l_47 standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [&amp;_&gt;_*]:min-w-0 whitespace-normal break-words print:block standard-markdown"><p dir="ltr"><strong>1단계 — 영상 저장</strong></p>
<p dir="ltr">이 대화창에서 영상을 길게 눌러서 다운로드. 저장될 때 파일명을 <code>promo.mp4</code> 로 바꿔서 저장하세요.</p>
<hr>
<p dir="ltr"><strong>2단계 — 파일을 assets 폴더로 이동</strong></p>
<p dir="ltr">탐색기에서 <code>promo.mp4</code> 파일을 찾아서 <code>C:\Users\PC2503\Desktop\loop-web\assets</code> 폴더로 드래그해서 넣으세요.</p>
<p dir="ltr">단, loop-web 폴더가 없으면 Claude Code 먼저 열어서 이거 입력하세요:</p>
